<Base title="Brokerage Services | Midgett & Fite Real Estate" description="Full-service residential, commercial, and land brokerage in Middle Tennessee.">
  <h1>Brokerage Services</h1>

  <p>Buying or selling real estate? Midgett &amp; Fite currently markets homes for sale, commercial property, and land in Middle Tennessee. We've got you covered, and we want to serve you.</p>

  <h2>Knowledge is power for our SELLERS!</h2>
  <p>In any negotiation, the party with the most knowledge is in a position to make the best decision. We will evaluate your property relative to the market to help you make a wise choice about marketing your real estate.</p>
  <p>Whether you need a quick sale or are just testing the waters, we can provide you with the facts to help you price your property properly. Whether you are selling your home, commercial property, or land, let Midgett &amp; Fite be your source for real estate knowledge.</p>

  <h2>Knowledge is power for our BUYERS!</h2>
  <p>We provide current market trends to give you the confidence you need to make an informed buying decision. Property listings that meet your criteria will be e-mailed to you daily, or if you prefer, our automated system can check and send updates from the MLS hourly.</p>
  <p>Once you choose a property, we will structure the Purchase and Sale Agreement to protect your interests, and we can analyze the property relative to other similar parcels to assure you are paying a fair price. Midgett &amp; Fite will walk with you through the purchasing process to ensure your needs are met and your purchase is sound.</p>

